graph TD
    A([📋 Start: Log In to
Registrar Control Panel]) --> B[(ERP DB: Load Current Term
Registration Configuration)]
    B --> C[View Registration Tiers
& Current Priority Rules]
    C --> D{Configure
Priority Slots?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Define Tier Priority Order
e.g. Seniors→Juniors→Sophomores→Freshmen]
    E --> F[Assign Date & Time Windows
Per Tier]
    F --> G[(ERP DB: Save Priority
Slot Configuration for Term)]
    G --> H{Notify Students
of Time Slots?}
    H -- Yes --> I[(ERP System: Trigger Bulk
Email Notifications by Tier)]
    I --> J[Students Receive
Registration Window Emails]
    H -- No --> K[Continue Without
Immediate Notification]
    J --> L[Monitor Registration
Go-Live Dashboard]
    K --> L
    D -- No --> L
    L --> M[(ERP DB: Stream Live Data:
Concurrent Users, Seats, Errors)]
    M --> N{System
Anomaly Detected?}
    N -- No --> O[Monitor Metrics:
Concurrency, Queue Depth, Seat Fill Rate]
    O --> P{Registration
Period Active?}
    P -- Yes --> M
    N -- High Concurrency Spike --> Q[Alert Support Technician Team
Via Ticket System]
    Q --> R[Coordinate Load Mitigation:
Queue Management or Rate Limiting]
    R --> M
    N -- Data Integrity Issue --> S[(ERP DB: Run Seat
Reconciliation Process)]
    S --> T{Reconciliation
Successful?}
    T -- Yes --> M
    T -- No --> U[Escalate to System Admin
Pause Affected Sections if Needed]
    U --> M
    P -- No: Period Ended --> V[(ERP DB: Generate Final
Enrollment Report)]
    V --> W([✅ End: Registration Term Closed])